F3DF                             ; ---- the line reader of -n? (see h_key) --------------------------------------
F3DF                             ; Backspace takes the last character back (and is echoed as it is), CR ends
F3DF                             ; (stored, not echoed), every other key is stored and echoed until the line
F3DF                             ; is full. B = the length so far; the low byte of the top cell becomes the
F3DF                             ; most allowed (it holds minus the count on entry).
